OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells during the
OL,6,Fmorning, with cloud becoming more
OL,7,Fextensive during the afternoon.
OL,8,FIsolated light showers are possible,
OL,9,Fbut most places are expected to stay
OL,10,Fdry. Light winds inland but breezy
OL,11,Falong the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,14,Fjust an isolated shower near the
OL,15,Fcoast. Clear spells for many,
OL,16,Fespecially after midnight. Light winds
OL,17,Finland but breezier near the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
