OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAfter a bright start cloud
OL,6,Fwill increase with scattered, mainly
OL,7,Flight, showers likely through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Breezy, especially near the
OL,9,Fcoast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,13,Fcoming days, bringing partly cloudy
OL,14,Fconditions with occasional showers,
OL,15,Fand an easterly breeze. Temperatures
OL,16,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
